<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-labeling> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Module for the labels and symbols required on batteries in EU Digital Product Passports: separate collection symbol, the cadmium symbol and the lead symbol, extinguishing agent information and label symbol. Covers the battery-specific fields of the 'Symbols, labels and documentation of conformity' category of the BatteryPass-Ready Data Attribute Long List required by Regulation (EU) 2023/1542, and the Spherity Battery Pass Labeling entities."@en .
